SUMMARY:Delta Sleep with Michael Cera Palin
DESCRIPTION:On ‘Blue Garden’\, Delta Sleep’s 4th studio album\, out 27th September on Sofa Boy Records & Wax Bodega (US)\, the band find themselves digging beneath the overwhelming darkness of the world to find just a glimmer of light — tying in similar themes across their expansive back catalogue to become what is perhaps their heaviest record to date. \nAn emo band from Atlanta\, Georgia
