SUMMARY:Beginner Fused Glass: Bugs!
DESCRIPTION:Learn the basics of glass fusing while creating your own unique bug. Choose from several templates or design your own! Students will learn the basics of cutting and grinding glass\, while also learning about the different types of glass and fusing. Glass pieces will be fired after class and ready for pick up approximately one week after class. You will be contacted to arrange pick up.
