SUMMARY:Mahjong Night
DESCRIPTION:Want to try a fun\, strategic game that’s been played for centuries? Join us at Glass Jug Downtown for an evening of Mahjong! Mahjong is a mesmerizing game of skill\, strategy\, and calculation involving domino-like tiles. It’s easy to learn but offers endless depth\, making it incredibly addictive. Get Your Mahjong NC and Mahj with Blair will teach a hands-on class to learn the basics of American Mahjong\, to build confidence\, and start playing right away. No experience needed – we’ll bring everything. Already played\, but still need assistance with the game? We’ll also have guided play. Come from 6:30 – 8:30pm to learn to build sequences\, pairs\, pungs\, and kongs while enjoying our rotating selection of craft beer and unique cocktails. Join us to learn a new skill\, challenge your brain\, and maybe even find your lucky tile! Introduction Class for beginners: $40/pp Guided Play: $20/pp Open Play: $10/pp Simply email getyourmahjongnc@gmail.com to reserve your space on any date and pay. View on Facebook.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/mahjong-night/
LOCATION:The Glass Jug Downtown\, 545 Foster Street\, Suite 10\, Durham\, 27701
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/image-2026-06-12T130528.291.jpg
GEO:36.0014902;-78.9018252
