SUMMARY:Ally J on the Roof
DESCRIPTION:We’re hosting performances from Durham’s own Ally J on the Roof once a month\, March through October. Head up to the Roof on Wednesday\, April 15th\, for our $14 Girl Dinner special\, $6 glasses of rosé and bubbly\, and live music from Ally J 7:30-9pm. \nAlly J on the Roof Girl Dinner \n$6 Glasses of Rosé & Bubbles\n$14 Girl Dinner | A curated tray with\nguac and chips\nflavored popcorn\npickled veggies\nlocal cheeses\nCome for the music\, stay for the city views\, craft cocktails\, and a night to remember. No cover\, just good vibes.
