SUMMARY:Our Day Out Remembrance March & Resource Fair
DESCRIPTION:Our Day Out Remembrance March & Resource Fair is the final official event for the Pride: Durham\, NC Event Series (JUNE SATURDAYS) for National Pride Month\, commemorating the first Pride March in North Carolina on June 27\, 1981. Community members are invited to gather for a non-violent rally and march in Downtown Durham\, starting at CCB Plaza and ending at the LGBTQ Center of Durham (114 Hunt St) with public speakers\, an open house\, and a resource fair.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/our-day-out-remembrance-march-resource-fair/
